g the homunculus hears. The range of this link is 1,500 feet. The homunculus adopts the same alignment as its creator and is utterly faithful. If the homunculus is destroyed, the master takes @Damage[2d10[mental]] damage. If the master is slain, the homunculus becomes mindless, claims its current location as its lair, and instinctively attacks anyone who comes near.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["arcane","mental"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","systemVersion":"8.5.0","compendiumSource":null},"effects":[],"_key":"!actors.items!G2ILjsWkOq6yvHAp.kJ3xBADJasQJPN6d"},{"_id":"3lJBv7HwAjkSPmgN","img":"systems/pf2e/icons/actions/Passive.webp","name":"Perfume Aura","sort":400000,"system":{"actionType":{"value":"passive"},"actions":{"value":null},"category":"defensive","description":{"value":"<p>5 feet. The scented candle homunculus's fragrance of lavender is overwhelmingly intense. Any creature other than the homunculus's master who enters the aura must attempt a @Check[fortitude|dc:15] save.</p>\n<hr />\n<p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The creature is temporarily immune to the homunculus's aura for 24 hours.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The creature is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.fesd1n5eVhpCSS18]{Sickened 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The creature is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.e1XGnhKNSQIm5IXg]{Stupefied 1} for 1 round and sickened 1.</p>"},"publication":{"license":"OGL","remaster":false,"title":""},"rules":[{"key":"Aura","radius":5,"slug":"perfume-aura","traits":["olfactory","poison"]}],"slug":null,"traits":{"rarity":"common","value":["aura","olfactory","poison"]},"_migration":{"version":0.959,"previous":null}},"type":"action","_stats":{"coreVersion":"14.361","systemId":"pf2e","sys